nd Developer Intern</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-neutral-400 mt-1\">Luciety</p></div><span class=\"text-xs font-semibold text-neutral-500 uppercase tracking-wider whitespace-nowrap\">Sep 2025 - Jan 2026</span></div><p class=\"mt-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-neutral-400\">Engineered secure backend services in Go, implementing OAuth2, JWT authentication, and payment integration while optimizing PostgreSQL database performance.</p><div class=\"mt-4 flex flex-wrap gap-2\"><span class=\"text-xs font-medium text-accent-400 bg-accent-500/10 border border-accent-500/20 px-2.5 py-1 rounded\">Go</span><span class=\"text-xs font-medium text-accent-400 bg-accent-500/10 border border-accent-500/20 px-2.5 py-1 rounded\">PostgreSQL</span><span class=\"text-xs font-medium text-accent-400 bg-accent-500/10 border border-accent-500/20 px-2.5 py-1 rounded\">JWT</span><span class=\"text-xs font-medium text-accent-400 bg-accent-500/10 border border-accent-500/20 px-2.5 py-1 rounded\">OAuth2</span><span class=\"text-xs font-medium text-accent-400 bg-accent-500/10 border border-accent-500/20 px-2.5 py-1 rounded\">Payment Systems</span></div></div><div class=\"card p-6\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2 sm:flex-row sm:items-start sm:justify-between sm:gap-4\"><div class=\"flex-1\"><h3 class=\"text-lg font-semibold text-white\">Wing Chief - CP Wings</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-neutral-400 mt-1\">UITS Computer Club</p></div><span class=\"text-xs font-semibold text-neutral-500 uppercase tracking-wider whitespace-nowrap\">Jun 2025 - Jun 2026</span></div><p class=\"mt-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-neutral-400\">Led competitive programming activities, organized university programming contests, managed contest infrastructure, and mentored students in algorithmic problem solving.</p><div class=\"mt-4 flex flex-wrap gap-2\"><span class=\"text-xs font-medium text-accent-400 bg-accent-500/10 border border-accent-500/20 px-2.5 py-1 rounded\">Leadership</span><span class=\"text-xs font-medium text-accent-400 bg-accent-500/10 border border-accent-500/20 px-2.5 py-1 rounded\">Competitive Programming</span><span class=\"text-xs font-medium text-accent-400 bg-accent-500/10 border border-accent-500/20 px-2.5 py-1 rounded\">Mentoring</span><span class=\"text-xs font-medium text-accent-400 bg-accent-500/10 border border-accent-500/20 px-2.5 py-1 rounded\">Events</span></div></div><div class=\"card p-6\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2 sm:flex-row sm:items-start sm:justify-between sm:gap-4\"><div class=\"flex-1\"><h3 class=\"text-lg font-semibold text-white\">Competitive Programmer</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-neutral-400 mt-1\">University of Information Technology &amp; Sciences</p></div><span class=\"text-xs font-semibold text-neutral-500 uppercase tracking-wider whitespace-nowrap\">Jan 2022 - Present</span></div><p class=\"mt-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-neutral-400\">Solved 2000+ algorithmic problems, participated in 180+ programming contests, and represented the university in inter-university competitive programming events.</p><div class=\"mt-4 flex flex-wrap gap-2\"><span class=\"text-xs font-medium text-accent-400 bg-accent-500/10 border border-accent-500/20 px-2.5 py-1 rounded\">DSA</span><span class=\"text-xs font-medium text-accent-400 bg-accent-500/10 border border-accent-500/20 px-2.5 py-1 rounded\">Algorithms</span><span class=\"text-xs font-medium text-accent-400 bg-accent-500/10 border border-accent-500/20 px-2.5 py-1 rounded\">Problem Solving</span><span class=\"text-xs font-medium text-accent-400 bg-accent-500/10 border border-accent-500/20 px-2.5 py-1 rounded\">Codeforces</span><span class=\"text-xs font-medium text-accent-400 bg-accent-500/10 border border-accent-500/20 px-2.5 py-1 rounded\">LeetCode</span></div></div></div></div></section><section id=\"testimonials\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-[1440px] space-y-8\"><div><p class=\"text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-accent-400\">Testimonials</p><h2 class=\"text-4xl font-bold text-whit